We're not doing it in 3D. We don't have the rendering power, time, or
skill necessary to do this, and the animation style to be used does
not lend well to 3D. Flash more than likely will be used, or if the
frame animator has a preference, we'll provide raster keyframes and
then ey can do whatever ey wants.

That aside, I'd appreciate it if I could get you to do a little voice
acting once we get to that phase. Even if you can only do a small
part, I think it would be great. Each episode we need maybe one to two
characters that aren't regulars to do things like voice teachers, shop-
keepers, and other such things.

